$ deprecated --help
usage: deprecated [--grid value] [--mesh value] [--help] [--markdown] [--version] {legacy,run} ...

Optional switches:
  --grid value
      default value g.grd
      Grid file (DEPRECATED: use --mesh instead)
  --mesh value
      default value m.grd
      Mesh file
  --help, -h
      Print this help message
  --markdown, -md
      Save this help message in a Markdown file
  --version, -v
      Print version

Commands:
  legacy
      The old solver (DEPRECATED: use run)
  run
      The solver

For more detailed commands help try:
  deprecated legacy -h,--help
  deprecated run -h,--help
